**Title**: Tranquil Tides: A Journey with Alex and Ripple

**Description**: Join Alex, an imaginative 11-year-old, and their playful sea otter friend, Ripple, on a serene adventure along a coastal shoreline as the sun dips beneath the horizon. In this calming tale, Alex's journey is one of resilience, embracing the gentle challenges that arise while walking the sandy shores and stepping across smooth stones in a swelling inlet. The soothing whispers of the ocean and the rhythmic dance of the waves guide them into a sense of peace and belonging. Designed to cradle you into a restful slumber, this sleep story invites you to lower your anxieties, foster emotional calm, and drift into a dream filled with the gentle lullabies of the sea. 

